      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working in a repair shop and just opened up a high-end phone and the battery is clearly swollen/bloated. What's the immediate SOP for handling this and how do I safely dispose of it? I need the safety steps asap.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
