      "content": "It is purely the chemistry, not any sort of malicious intent from the battery. The swelling is a physical manifestation of internal chemical reactions—gases building up inside the sealed cell because the internal components are degrading or overcharging. Think of it like a very poorly managed, highly pressurized, miniature gas chamber that has developed a severe case of internal bloating.\n\nYour nervousness is completely justified, though, because these chemical reactions are unpredictable, which is why we treat them with extreme caution. You are not crazy; you are being appropriately cautious around a volatile chemical hazard.\n\nFor the next steps, keep it isolated in that sand-filled ceramic bowl, away from any heat sources, and focus on getting it to a certified hazardous waste handler. Do not attempt any further repairs on it.",
